# SwiftFormat configuration for Scrawl.
#
# NOTE: the codebase has not been reformatted with SwiftFormat yet, so the first
# `make format` will produce a sizable one-time diff (~700 lines). Apply it as
# its own dedicated commit (e.g. "style: apply swiftformat"), separate from
# feature work, then turn on the `swiftformat --lint` gate in CI.

--swiftversion 5.10
--ranges nospace
--exclude .build,.worktrees,.swiftpm,.git

# redundantSendable is a Swift-6-language-mode transform that strips explicit
# `Sendable` conformances. This package targets the 5.10 language mode, where
# those conformances are not redundant, so keep them.
--disable redundantSendable
